Cosmos CLI family
=================

This repository vendors the following third-party data:

meridian-bridge/vendor/o200k_base.tiktoken
    BPE rank table for the o200k_base encoding, from OpenAI's tiktoken
    project (https://github.com/openai/tiktoken), MIT License.
    Used offline by meridian-bridge's tokenizer; never fetched at runtime.

All other code in this repository was written for this project.
